WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.298
One event, two ways in.

2
00:00:02.994 --> 00:00:04.997
Plus, Create event,

3
00:00:04.997 --> 00:00:06.168
Ticketed event.

4
00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:16.672
Name it, then set the format to Hybrid.

5
00:00:17.526 --> 00:00:19.710
That one choice is what makes

6
00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:21.986
the next two things possible.

7
00:00:22.682 --> 00:00:25.182
Vibes and genres become tags,

8
00:00:25.193 --> 00:00:26.856
then a line about the night.

9
00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:31.219
Step two:

10
00:00:31.522 --> 00:00:32.322
when.

11
00:00:32.914 --> 00:00:35.108
One date, doors at eight,

12
00:00:35.144 --> 00:00:37.710
ends at eleven, New York time.

13
00:00:38.213 --> 00:00:40.524
Guests see it in that zone.

14
00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:44.962
Step three is where

15
00:00:45.097 --> 00:00:46.624
and for a hybrid,

16
00:00:46.624 --> 00:00:47.813
it's both.

17
00:00:48.325 --> 00:00:50.919
Name the venue and pick the address.

18
00:00:51.336 --> 00:00:53.661
Hide address is on by default;

19
00:00:53.757 --> 00:00:56.442
turn it off and it shows publicly.

20
00:00:57.293 --> 00:00:59.199
The stream link underneath

21
00:00:59.199 --> 00:01:01.137
goes to ticket holders only.

22
00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:09.829
Step four,

23
00:01:09.959 --> 00:01:10.855
the cover.

24
00:01:11.143 --> 00:01:12.407
A video cover,

25
00:01:12.407 --> 00:01:14.054
under fifteen seconds,

26
00:01:14.054 --> 00:01:17.070
and Mingla makes a browser-safe copy.

27
00:01:17.703 --> 00:01:20.179
Then up to eight more photos

28
00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:21.190
three here.

29
00:01:21.684 --> 00:01:24.455
Guests swipe through them after the cover.

30
00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:30.643
Step five is where the format cashes out.

31
00:01:31.149 --> 00:01:33.339
The first ticket is the room:

32
00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:35.531
name it, one dollar,

33
00:01:35.601 --> 00:01:37.453
and a capacity of sixty

34
00:01:37.596 --> 00:01:39.423
the number the room holds.

35
00:01:40.126 --> 00:01:41.243
Turn the waitlist

36
00:01:41.243 --> 00:01:42.924
on for when that runs out.

37
00:01:43.355 --> 00:01:46.298
Available at is set per ticket:

38
00:01:46.665 --> 00:01:48.778
leave the room on Online

39
00:01:48.778 --> 00:01:50.169
and at the door,

40
00:01:50.205 --> 00:01:52.770
so you can also sell on the night.

41
00:01:53.531 --> 00:01:55.347
Now the second ticket.

42
00:01:55.723 --> 00:01:56.964
Same price

43
00:01:57.036 --> 00:01:59.594
but turn Unlimited capacity on

44
00:01:59.594 --> 00:02:02.278
and the Capacity field disappears.

45
00:02:02.938 --> 00:02:05.274
A stream doesn't sell out.

46
00:02:05.778 --> 00:02:07.743
Set it to Online only,

47
00:02:07.743 --> 00:02:10.270
because there's no door for a stream pass.

48
00:02:11.052 --> 00:02:12.177
Two tickets,

49
00:02:12.177 --> 00:02:13.106
one night.

50
00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:18.063
Settings.

51
00:02:18.534 --> 00:02:19.707
Keep it public,

52
00:02:19.707 --> 00:02:21.633
and pick a refund policy:

53
00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:24.213
Standard is a full refund

54
00:02:24.213 --> 00:02:25.462
fourteen days out,

55
00:02:25.603 --> 00:02:27.538
half inside thirteen,

56
00:02:27.746 --> 00:02:29.356
none inside seven.

57
00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:34.105
Step seven shows the event

58
00:02:34.105 --> 00:02:35.945
the way guests will see it.

59
00:02:36.548 --> 00:02:37.458
Publish,

60
00:02:37.458 --> 00:02:40.234
and both tickets go on sale at once

61
00:02:40.359 --> 00:02:42.594
the room and the stream,

62
00:02:42.594 --> 00:02:44.095
on one page.

63
00:02:44.772 --> 00:02:47.674
Every customer Mingla drives your way

64
00:02:47.674 --> 00:02:49.005
lands right here.
